                    %mrow
                      %mn 5
                      %mo −
                      %mn 2
                      %mo =
                      %mn 3
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} 5-2 = 3
            %p The other exceptional isomorphism of relevance is
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi 𝔰𝔬
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mn 6
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mo ≃
