                %a{:href => "http://profmattstrassler.com/articles-and-posts/the-higgs-particle/taking-stock-of-the-higgs-jan-2013/5-supersymmetry/"} 5. Supersymmetry?
          %h3#supersymmetry_in_the_standard_model_of_cosmology Supersymmetry in the standard model of cosmology
